<h2 id="h3-and-h3-postgis" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-tighter"><span>H3 and H3 PostGIS</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#h3-and-h3-postgis" aria-label="Link to H3 and H3 PostGIS"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3.5"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h2>
<p>H3 is a hierarchical geospatial indexing system. It divides the earth&#x27;s surface into hexagonal cells at multiple resolutions, and provides a unique addressing system for location data. It is used for applications like optimizing delivery zones and service areas, geospatial aggregation, and analytics.</p>
<p>The H3 functionality is split into two extensions: <code>h3</code> and <code>h3_postgis</code>.</p>
<h3 id="enable-the-h3-and-h3postgis-extensions" class="anchor-heading group relative w-fit scroll-mt-20 leading-tight font-medium lg:scroll-mt-5 tracking-extra-tight"><span>Enable the H3 and H3_PostGIS extensions</span><a class="rounded-full px-2 no-underline opacity-0 transition-opacity duration-200 group-hover:opacity-100 hover:border-none hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 focus-visible:outline-offset-0 sm:hidden" href="#enable-the-h3-and-h3postgis-extensions" aria-label="Link to Enable the H3 and H3_PostGIS extensions"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 14 14" class="inline text-green-44 dark:text-green-52 w-3"><path stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.4" d="m3.938 12.688 1.75-11.375M8.313 12.688l1.75-11.375M3.063 4.813h8.75M2.188 9.188h8.75"></path></svg></a></h3>
